TI  - Tracheotomy: an alternative for tracheobronchial foreign body removal.
PG  - 241-3
AB  - A 6 years old girl accidentally aspirated a plastic whistle while playing. 
      Computed Tomography of thorax showed foreign body at carina level. Rigid 
      bronchoscope under general anesthesia was attempted but unable to extract the 
      whistle through vocal cord. Tracheostomy was later performed and foreign body was 
      removed.
