AB  - Foreign body aspiration is a potentially fatal condition. Yet, an accurate 
      diagnosis may not be easy. Management is also challenging and requires a high 
      level of expertise with proper instruments. In this article, we report our 
      experience in the management of peanut aspiration in two young children by means 
      of a ventilating bronchoscope.
