TI  - Closure of a bronchopleural fistula using glue.
PG  - 117-8
LID - 10.1510/icvts.2011.270397 [doi]
AB  - Bronchopleural fistula after pneumonectomy remains a challenge after lung cancer 
      surgery. It is associated with high mortality, morbidity and prolonged hospital 
      stay necessitating further thoracotomy. We describe a technique using 
      intra-mucosal injection of glue to close a bronchopleural fistula via 
      bronchoscopy.
