TI  - Accessory bronchus in a patient with chronic cough.
PG  - 150-1
LID - 10.1097/LBR.0b013e31828d33ec [doi]
AB  - The accessory bronchus involving the trachea or main bronchi is very rare. In 
      this report, we present images of an accessory bronchus, detected by computed 
      tomography scan and flexible bronchoscopy. Our patient was suffering from 
      persistent productive cough and had normal chest x-ray. We review the literature 
      to establish relationship between our patient's symptoms and this congenital 
      anomaly.
