AB  - Tracheobronchial rupture is a rare diagnosis with very high associated mortality 
      in the neonatal population. Our case demonstrates the opportunity to diagnose 
      this entity in a neonate via CT and introduces the utility of virtual 
      bronchoscopy in clinical scenarios that preclude traditional bronchoscopy.
