TI  - Controlling hemoptysis: An alternative approach.
PG  - 99-101
LID - 10.4103/0970-2113.63616 [doi]
AB  - Hemoptysis is a very common symptom in the practice of pulmonary physicians of 
      India. We present a case of uncontrolled hemoptysis managed with bronchial artery 
      embolization. Bronchial artery embolization is an effective treatment for 
      patients with hemoptysis. Serious complications are rare, but may occur if the 
      arterial supply to other structures is compromised.
