      the role of rapid PCR testing for MRSA in hospitalized patients and the use of 
      vancomycin or metronidazole for treatment of Clostridium difficile colitis. He 
      has also received speaker's honoraria related to new anti-bacterial agents from 
      Janssen-Ortho, Pfizer and Astellas Pharma during the past five years. This does 
      not alter the authors' adherence to all the PLoS ONE policies on sharing data and 
      materials.
