TI  - Cluster of pseudoinfections with Burkholderia cepacia associated with a 
      contaminated washer-disinfector in a bronchoscopy unit.
PG  - 769-71
LID - 10.1086/653611 [doi]
AB  - In December 2008, bronchoalveolar lavage fluid samples obtained from 3 patients 
      were positive for Burkholderia cepacia complex on culture. Samples obtained from 
      bronchoscopes and rinse-water samples obtained from the washer-disinfector were 
      found to be positive for B. cepacia complex. The cause of this pseudo-outbreak 
      was that the washer-disinfector was installed without the required antibacterial 
      filter.
