TI  - Virtual bronchoscopy in the era of multi-detector computed tomography: Is there 
      any reality?
PG  - 305-10
LID - 10.1016/j.mjafi.2012.12.005 [doi]
AB  - Virtual bronchoscopy, in conjunction with axial and MPR MDCT images, can enhance 
      diagnostic accuracy of tracheo-bronchial endoluminal pathologies. We describe a 
      few cases highlighting the utility of virtual bronchoscopy in the diagnosis of 
      varied tracheo-bronchial pathologies encountered in the setting of a tertiary 
      care Armed Forces Hospital of India.
